    "text": "By Isla Davenport ,\n5 hours ago Lunch here feels rooted in memory and habit. It unfolds in places where recipes have been repeated for decades and the midday meal still carries weight. Maryland brings together old-world deli counters, waterfront kitchens, and grill smoke that drifts in from parking lots and backyards. Sandwiches arrive stacked and unapologetic.... Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
